# hachimaki-dev — Windsurf Rules

## Project
Personal website: React 18 + Vite + CSS native + Supabase. Single admin. GitHub Pages deploy.

## Critical Rules
- JavaScript ONLY — no TypeScript (.ts/.tsx)
- CSS variables ONLY from `src/styles/tokens.css` — never hardcode colors/sizes/fonts
- NO CSS frameworks (Tailwind, Bootstrap, etc.)
- Import Supabase client from `src/lib/supabase.js` ONLY — never create new instances
- NO localStorage for business data — only Supabase
- Handle loading + error + empty states in every async component
- Use `useToast()` for user feedback
- Migrations go in `migrations/NNN_desc.sql` (local, gitignored)
- kebab-case CSS classes, PascalCase components, camelCase hooks/utils

## Structure
- `src/components/ui/` → Primitives (Button, Input, Card, Modal, Toast, PageLoader, EmptyState, Badge, Countdown, NewsletterInvite)
- `src/components/layout/` → Header, Footer, PageWrapper, AdminLayout
- `src/pages/public/` → Public pages (Home, Blog, BlogPost, Portfolio, ProjectDetail, PhotosPage, VisitantesPage, ContactPage) | `src/pages/public/Stream/` → StreamRoomPage, CasterPage, ViewerPage, StreamChat
- `src/pages/admin/` → Admin CRUD pages (behind AuthGuard - Dashboard, Settings, Contact, Subscriptions) | `src/pages/admin/Streams/` → AdminStreamsPage
- `src/features/` → Domain logic (auth, blog, portfolio, streaming, visitor, contact, subscriptions, friends)
- `src/features/streaming/lib/` → signalingChannel, peerManager, viewerPeer, signalingCleanup, streamLogger
- `src/features/streaming/hooks/` → useMediaDevices, useMediaRecorder, useRooms, usePresence, usePublicLiveStreams, useRecordingUpload, useChat, useSpeechTranscription
- `src/features/friends/` → useFriendLinks, useFriendLinksAdmin
- `src/features/visitor/hooks/` → useVisitorTracker, useVisitorLogs
- `src/features/contact/` → useContact, useContactAdmin
- `src/features/subscriptions/` → useSubscriptions, useSubscriptionsAdmin
- `src/styles/tokens.css` → ALL design tokens — ALWAYS use these

## DB: profiles, blog_posts, projects, rooms, room_members, stream_state, signaling_messages, recordings, chat_messages, photos, visitor_logs, contact_messages, subscriptions, stream_transcriptions, friend_links (Supabase PostgreSQL + RLS)
## Accent: #c8f000 | Font: Space Grotesk | Theme: dark (#0d0d0d)

